1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,236
Hi, I'm Kino.

2
00:00:02,236 --> 00:00:05,844
I watch your WhatsApp group
photos and find your kids in them,

3
00:00:05,844 --> 00:00:08,043
all on your own machine.

4
00:00:08,051 --> 00:00:13,391
Faces are detected with SCRFD and matched
with AuraFace, locally on the CPU.

5
00:00:13,391 --> 00:00:18,902
Nothing leaves your machine except
the photo you ask me to forward.

6
00:00:19,742 --> 00:00:22,244
On first run, choose the admin password.

7
00:00:22,244 --> 00:00:27,976
Do this from your local network,
before exposing Kino anywhere.

8
00:00:27,983 --> 00:00:29,559
Next, connect OpenWA.

9
00:00:29,559 --> 00:00:31,511
Enter its URL and API key,

10
00:00:31,511 --> 00:00:38,101
then use Generate for the webhook
secret, and pick the session.

11
00:00:38,106 --> 00:00:41,924
The phone number is masked, and
I register the webhook for you.

12
00:00:41,924 --> 00:00:45,480
Now I can receive group photos.

13
00:00:45,486 --> 00:00:49,366
On the Kids page, add each kid
and watch the coverage meter.

14
00:00:49,366 --> 00:00:59,123
Auto-save is off by default, so
nothing is saved until you decide.

15
00:00:59,604 --> 00:01:02,759
Matches I am not sure about
wait in the Review queue.

16
00:01:02,759 --> 00:01:08,087
Confirm, reject, or tell me it's someone
else, and I learn from each answer.

17
00:01:08,093 --> 00:01:10,743
References are the
faces I compare against.

18
00:01:10,743 --> 00:01:15,834
Outliers are flagged, so you can
retire the ones that look wrong.

19
00:01:15,845 --> 00:01:19,688
The Gallery shows the photos I
identified, grouped by month.

20
00:01:19,688 --> 00:01:24,630
Open one to see its kids and
group, or remove it from a kid.

21
00:01:24,637 --> 00:01:28,757
On Groups, choose which chats to
watch and map each one to its kids.

22
00:01:28,757 --> 00:01:34,539
You can also backfill recent history, so
I can start with photos you already have.

23
00:01:34,547 --> 00:01:37,356
Activity shows how each
image was processed,

24
00:01:37,356 --> 00:01:40,611
including every face it
found and the score it got.

25
00:01:40,611 --> 00:01:44,670
It is the place to look
when a photo was not saved.

26
00:01:44,677 --> 00:01:47,706
The Test page lets you
move the threshold sliders

27
00:01:47,706 --> 00:01:52,924
and preview the result
before enabling auto-save.

28
00:01:52,930 --> 00:01:55,553
Who is this? groups
unknown faces together.

29
00:01:55,553 --> 00:02:00,928
Pick a group, choose the kid, and
those faces become references.

30
00:02:00,936 --> 00:02:03,907
In Settings, set where
saved photos are forwarded,

31
00:02:03,907 --> 00:02:06,285
and turn on sending them with a caption.

32
00:02:06,285 --> 00:02:11,108
You can also choose the chat and
schedule for the review digest.

33
00:02:11,113 --> 00:02:13,905
Use the toggle to switch
between light and dark.

34
00:02:13,905 --> 00:02:21,237
The layout also fits a phone screen.

35
00:02:21,242 --> 00:02:22,155
That's the tour.

36
00:02:22,155 --> 00:02:27,796
Thanks for watching!
